-- FALLBACK PLAYERS PANEL: only when CoreGui is NOT readable (plain LocalScript, e.g. Studio).
-- A LocalScript cannot touch the real Tab list or Esc menu, so this gives a
-- clickable head list of our own. Click a head (or row) -> opens the editor.
